### E-commerce flow through the API gateway  (IntelliJ HTTP client – run top to bottom)
@gw = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "john", "email": "john@mail.com", "password": "secret123" }

### 2. Login as user (stores the token)
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "john", "password": "secret123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Login as admin (stores the admin token)
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Browse products (public)
GET {{gw}}/api/products

### 5. Admin creates a product
POST {{gw}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kindle", "description": "E-reader", "price": 129.99, "stock": 30, "category": "Tablets" }

### 6. Add to favourites
POST {{gw}}/api/favourites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Add to cart
POST {{gw}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### 8. Show cart
GET {{gw}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Checkout (order + payment + shipment)
POST {{gw}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingAddress": "12 MG Road, Pune", "paymentMethod": "CARD" }

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### 10. Checkout that fails at payment (add something to the cart first)
POST {{gw}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingAddress": "12 MG Road, Pune", "paymentMethod": "CARD_DECLINED" }

### 11. My orders / payments
GET {{gw}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Shipment of the order
GET {{gw}}/api/shipments/order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Admin: ship, then deliver (shipment id = 1 for the first order)
PUT {{gw}}/api/shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }

###
PUT {{gw}}/api/shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### 14. Audit trail of the order (admin, events travelled via Kafka into MongoDB)
GET {{gw}}/api/audit?entityId={{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 15. Eureka registry
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json
